; Output: PART_LIMIT.M
; Console: PART_LIMIT.OUT
; PMDMML.MAN §16-3

#Title PART_LIMIT
#Option /v/c

; §16-3 Part Limited Specification (| |!)
AB @1 v10 |A c d |B e f | g a ; Part limited specification (|Parts MML)
AB @1 v10 |!A c d |!B e f | g a; Inverted part limited specification

; --- Part limited |! inverted spec edge cases ---
AB @1 v10 |!A c d e |!B f g a | b

; | part limited
AB @1 v10 |A c d |B e f | g a
; |! inverted part limited
AB @1 v10 |!A c d |!B e f | g a

; Part with | pipe for multi-part lines (one_line_compile | path, skip_mml)
AB| @1 v10 l4 c d e f
AB|!B g a b >c
